  The adaptation consists of three changes, all mechanical: a coding header, a
  removal of the hardcoded local ffmpeg path in favour of an injected one, and
  a parameter added to decode() and analyse() so the ffmpeg executable can be
  passed in. The detection algorithm itself is unchanged.

  If this ever stops being true, replace the module with an independently
  written beat detector or add the original copyright line here.

